# Atlas Core Component Token Specification & Style Dictionary Mapping
**Author:** Halo Okafor  
**Department:** Design  
**Project:** Atlas Core  
**Produced:** D17 14:15  
**Inputs used:** Business Document (Company Document)  
## Summary

Obsessively refactored Tier-3 component token architecture for Atlas Core, establishing normalized semantic bindings for SaaS and Face-to-Face hybrid interfaces based on specifications from Business Document: Company Document.

## Deliverable
```
{
  "$schema": "https://design-tokens.github.io/community-group/format/",
  "$metadata": {
    "project": "Atlas Core",
    "author": "Halo Okafor",
    "version": "2.4.0-refactored",
    "governance": "Derived from Business Document: Company Document to enforce strict dual-environment accessibility (WCAG 2.1 AAA) across our SaaS web dashboard and Face-to-Face tablet service touch targets."
  },
  "comp": {
    "button": {
      "primary": {
        "background": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.600}", "$type": "color" },
          "hover": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.700}", "$type": "color" },
          "active": { "$value": "{color.brand.primary.800}", "$type": "color" },
          "disabled": { "$value": "{color.neutral.200}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "text": {
          "default": { "$value": "{color.neutral.0}", "$type": "color" },
          "disabled": { "$value": "{color.neutral.400}", "$type": "color" }
        },
        "sizing": {
          "saas": {
            "minHeight": { "$value": "{size.spacing.40}", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "40px standard desktop SaaS click target" },
            "paddingInline": { "$value": "{size.spacing.16}", "$type": "dimension" }
          },
          "f2f": {
            "minHeight": { "$value": "{size.spacing.48}", "$type": "dimension", "$description": "48px expanded Face-to-Face touch boundary per Business Document: Company Document spec" },
            "paddingInline": { "$value": "{size.spacing.24}", "$type": "dimension" }
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "card": {
      "surface": {
        "background": { "$value": "{color.surface.layer1}", "$type": "color" },
        "border": { "$value": "{color.border.subtle}", "$type": "color" },
        "radius": { "$value": "{radius.md}", "$type": "dimension" },
        "elevation": { "$value": "{elevation.raised}", "$type": "shadow" }
      }
    }
  }
}
```